# `Saveable: Clock` is a supertrait clause. `Clock` names no base at all.
inherits | src/traits.rs | Saveable | Clock
implements | src/traits.rs | Ticks | Clock
implements | src/traits.rs | Ticks | Saveable
implements | src/traits.rs | Meters | Clock
